---
/**
 * /lawn/bundles/ — Natural Lawn Bundles + the bundle finder
 *
 * Replaces the Shopify page /pages/natural-lawn-bundles, which carried a
 * VideoAsk quiz (videoask.com/fyahikle6). Middleware had been redirecting that
 * URL to /lawn/homeowners/ — a page with no quiz on it — so every visitor
 * arriving from the four blog posts that still say "take our quick and easy
 * quiz" hit a dead end.
 *
 * Follows the StoryBrand structure the persona hubs use:
 * Hero → Problem → Finder → What's inside → Proof band → Plan → FAQ → CTA.
 *
 * The finder is a client island: two questions, a 3×3 lookup, no third party.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Breadcrumbs from '../../../components/shared/Breadcrumbs.astro'
import CloudinaryHero from '../../../components/CloudinaryHero.astro'
import AccordionFaq from '../../../components/shop/AccordionFaq.astro'
import BundleFinder from '../../../components/calculators/BundleFinder'
import { BUNDLE_PRODUCTS, LAWN_BUNDLES } from '../../../lib/lawnBundleData'
import { buildSouthlandUrl } from '../../../lib/cloudinary'

/**
 * 🛑 TITLE AND DESCRIPTION CARRY THE BUNDLE-INTENT VOCABULARY ON PURPOSE.
 *
 * GSC (90d, pulled 2026-08-05): the bundle PDP ranks for 200 queries and 7,106
 * impressions and earns 3 clicks, because it sits at position 30-75 on the
 * queries that matter — "best diy lawn care program" (38), "3 in 1 lawn care"
 * (31), "all in one lawn care" (75), "annual lawn programs" (78). Google knows
 * we sell a lawn program; it could not find a page that IS one, because the
 * page that should have answered was redirected to /lawn/homeowners/.
 *
 * "DIY", "all-in-one", "3-step", "annual program", "subscription" and "complete
 * lawn care program" are the entity gap. Do not strip them for brevity.
 */
const title = 'DIY Lawn Care Program: All-in-One Natural Lawn Bundles | Southland Organics'
const description =
  'A complete DIY lawn care program in one box — four natural products matched to your turf zone and lawn size, with a month-by-month schedule for the whole season. No harsh chemicals, no guesswork.'

const siteUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SITE_URL || 'https://southlandorganics.com'
const canonicalUrl = `${siteUrl}/lawn/bundles/`

const lowest = Math.min(...LAWN_BUNDLES.map((b) => b.price))
const highest = Math.max(...LAWN_BUNDLES.map((b) => b.price))

const ogImage = buildSouthlandUrl('Southland Website/heroes/lawn_result_ait3ra', {
  width: 1200,
  height: 630,
  crop: 'fill',
  gravity: 'auto',
  quality: 'auto',
  format: 'auto',
})

/**
 * 🛑 The first four answers are ANSWER-ENGINE entries, not marketing copy.
 *
 * They target the question-form queries GSC shows us ranking for at position
 * 30-75 with zero clicks ("best diy lawn care program", "3 in 1 lawn care",
 * "all in one lawn care", "annual lawn programs", "lawn fertilizer
 * subscription"). Each is written to stand alone if an AI engine lifts it out
 * of the page, which is the whole point — keep them self-contained.
 *
 * These render into FAQPage JSON-LD below. Do not shorten them into teasers.
 */
const faq = [
  {
    question: 'What is a DIY lawn care program?',
    answer:
      'A DIY lawn care program is a season-long plan you apply yourself instead of hiring a service — the right products, in the right order, at the right time of year. Southland Organics Natural Lawn Bundles are an all-in-one version: four natural products packaged together with a month-by-month schedule, sized to your turf zone and lawn size. You apply one product per month with a hose end sprayer, about fifteen minutes each time.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Is an all-in-one lawn care kit better than buying products separately?',
    answer:
      'For most homeowners, yes — because the hard part is not the application, it is knowing which product to use and when. An all-in-one bundle removes both decisions: it contains a full season of product in the correct quantities and tells you which month to apply each one. Buying separately works if you already know your program; if you are guessing, a bundle is cheaper than buying the wrong thing twice.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How many steps are in the Southland lawn program?',
    answer:
      'Four products across three seasons. Genesis conditions the soil in spring, FertALive and Omega feed and activate through summer, and Revival dethatches in fall. Depending on your turf zone that lands as five or six monthly applications between March and September — one product per month, using the whole bottle each time.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Do you offer a lawn care subscription?',
    answer:
      'The Natural Lawn Bundle is a one-time purchase covering a full growing season, not a recurring subscription. You buy the bundle once, apply it monthly through the season, and reorder the following spring. There is no auto-ship to cancel and no contract.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How do I know which turf zone I am in?',
    answer:
      'Your zone follows your climate, not your state line. Cool-season grasses (fescue, bluegrass, ryegrass) run through the northern states. Warm-season grasses (bermuda, zoysia, centipede, St. Augustine) run through the deep south. The transition zone in between is where both types struggle. The finder above lists the states in each band — pick the one your state appears in, and if you sit on a border, go by the grass type you actually have.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What if my lawn size is between two options?',
    answer:
      'Round up. The bundle sizing sets how much product you receive, and running short mid-season is worse than having a little left over. Small covers up to about 5,000 square feet, medium 5,000–10,000, and large anything above that.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Do I have to apply all four products?',
    answer:
      'Yes — that is the point of the bundle. Genesis conditions the soil in spring, FertALive and Omega feed and activate through summer, and Revival dethatches in fall. Each one does a different job at a different point in the season. Applying only one gets you a fraction of the result.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Is this safe around kids and pets?',
    answer:
      'Yes. Every product in the bundle is made from naturally derived ingredients with no synthetic chemicals and no warning label telling you to keep anyone off the grass. Your family and your dog can be back on the lawn as soon as you are done spraying.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What if I already have a sprayer?',
    answer:
      'Bundles 3, 6 and 9 ship in gallon containers for use with your own hose-end sprayer. The rest come with sprayer quarts that dilute automatically. Full dilution instructions for both are on the instructions page.',
  },
]

const pageSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebApplication',
  name: 'Lawn Bundle Finder',
  description,
  url: canonicalUrl,
  applicationCategory: 'UtilityApplication',
  operatingSystem: 'Web Browser',
  offers: {
    '@type': 'AggregateOffer',
    lowPrice: String(lowest),
    highPrice: String(highest),
    priceCurrency: 'USD',
    offerCount: String(LAWN_BUNDLES.length),
  },
  provider: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'Southland Organics',
    url: siteUrl,
    telephone: '+1-800-608-3755',
  },
}

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faq.map((item) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: item.question,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: item.answer },
  })),
}
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalUrl={canonicalUrl}
  ogImage={ogImage}
  schema={[pageSchema, faqSchema]}
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <CloudinaryHero
    publicId="Southland Website/heroes/lawn_result_ait3ra"
    alt="A lush green lawn grown with Southland Organics natural lawn bundles"
    height={560}
    minHeight="460px"
    overlay="gradient"
    overlayOpacity={88}
    contentAlign="center"
    contentJustify="start"
    priority={true}
  >
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl pb-12 pt-12 md:pt-20">
      <Breadcrumbs
        items={[
          { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
          { label: 'Lawn & Turf', href: '/lawn/' },
          { label: 'Natural Lawn Bundles' },
        ]}
        class="mb-4 [&_*]:text-sm [&_a]:text-white/80 [&_span]:text-white/60"
      />
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
          <span
            class="inline-block rounded-full bg-white/15 px-4 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-green-300"
          >
            For Homeowners
          </span>
          <span
            class="inline-block rounded-full bg-green-400/20 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-green-300"
          >
            Safe for Kids &amp; Pets
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1
          class="mb-4 font-heading text-4xl uppercase leading-tight text-white md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
        >
          Stop guessing which products your lawn needs.
        </h1>
        <p class="mb-5 text-lg text-white/70 md:text-xl">
          Two questions — your turf zone and your lawn size — and we'll match you to the bundle that
          carries your lawn through the entire growing season.
        </p>
        <div class="mb-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
            <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
            4 Products
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
            <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
            One Full Season
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
            <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
            Zero Synthetics
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="#finder"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[#44883E] px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[#44883E]/85"
          >
            Find My Bundle
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#ask"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border-2 border-white/30 px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:border-white/60 hover:bg-white/5"
          >
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            Ask Us About Your Lawn
          </a>
        </div>
        <div
          class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-sm text-white/80"
        >
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg
              class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-green-400"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path>
            </svg>
            ${lowest}–${highest} per season
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg
              class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-green-400"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path>
            </svg>
            9 bundles, matched to your climate
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </CloudinaryHero>

  <!-- PROBLEM
       🛑 The vocabulary here is deliberate, not filler. See the note above the
       page title: "DIY lawn care program", "all-in-one", "annual program" and
       "subscription" are the terms Google already ranks us for at position
       30-75 with no page that answers them. -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-4 font-heading text-3xl uppercase text-shopify-title md:text-4xl">
        The hardest part isn't the work. It's knowing what to buy.
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-600">
        Stand in front of a shelf of lawn products and every bottle claims to fix everything. So
        most people buy the cheapest bag, apply it whenever they remember, and wonder why the lawn
        looks the same in August as it did in April.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-600">
        A Natural Lawn Bundle is a <strong class="text-shopify-title">DIY lawn care program</strong>
        — an all-in-one kit holding a full season of product, so you are not buying a bag at a time and
        hoping the timing works out.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-600">
        A lawn in Athens doesn't need what a lawn in Minneapolis needs, and a quarter acre doesn't
        need what a half acre needs. <span class="font-semibold text-shopify-title"
          >Your climate and your square footage decide the answer</span
        > — which means it can be worked out in about ten seconds.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FINDER -->
  <section id="finder" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-gray-50 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4">
      <div class="mb-8 text-center">
        <span
          class="inline-block rounded-full bg-green-100 px-4 py-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-green-800"
        >
          Two questions
        </span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl uppercase text-shopify-title md:text-4xl">
          Find your bundle.
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-gray-600">No email required to see your answer.</p>
      </div>
      <BundleFinder client:load />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TALK TO US — VideoAsk -->
  <!--
    🛑 This is the ORIGINAL bundle quiz (videoask.com/fyahikle6), restored to the
    main site. It has only ever been reachable on shop.southlandorganics.com,
    which we do not promote, because middleware redirected all three lawn pages
    away from it. Its historical numbers (62 landings / 2 completions per 30d)
    describe traffic that leaked past a redirect — they are NOT a conversion
    baseline and must not be quoted as one.

    Running it alongside the two-question finder on purpose: the finder answers
    "which bundle", the video answers "should I trust these people". Different
    jobs. Both are tracked, so after 30 days there is a real comparison instead
    of an argument.
  -->
  <section id="ask" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4">
      <div class="mb-8 text-center">
        <span
          class="inline-block rounded-full bg-green-100 px-4 py-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-green-800"
        >
          Rather talk it through?
        </span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl uppercase text-shopify-title md:text-4xl">
          Ask us about your lawn.
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-gray-600">
          A short video walkthrough — tell us what your lawn is doing and we'll point you at the
          right program. Answer by video, voice or text, whichever you prefer.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.videoask.com/fyahikle6"
          title="Find the right lawn products for you — video walkthrough"
          loading="lazy"
          allow="camera *; microphone *; autoplay *; encrypted-media *; fullscreen *; display-capture *"
          class="h-[600px] w-full border-0"></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-center text-sm text-gray-500">
        Prefer to skip ahead? <a href="#finder" class="font-semibold text-[#44883E] hover:underline"
          >Use the two-question finder</a
        > instead.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT'S INSIDE -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
      <div class="mb-12 text-center">
        <h2 class="mb-3 font-heading text-3xl uppercase text-shopify-title md:text-4xl">
          Four products. One full season.
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-gray-600">
          Every bundle contains the same four products. Your zone and lawn size change the
          quantities and container sizes — never the roles.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {
          BUNDLE_PRODUCTS.map((p, i) => (
            <div class="group rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg">
              <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-100 text-sm font-bold text-green-700">
                  {i + 1}
                </span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-heading text-lg uppercase text-shopify-title">{p.name}</h3>
                  <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[#44883E]">{p.role}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">{p.blurb}</p>
              <a
                href={`/products/${p.handle}/`}
                class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-[#44883E] transition-colors hover:underline group-hover:gap-2"
              >
                About {p.name}
                <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROOF BAND -->
  <section class="bg-[#2C5234] py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-center font-heading text-3xl uppercase text-white md:text-4xl">
        Why a bundle beats a shelf.
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-lg text-center text-sm text-green-200/80">
        Matched to your climate, timed to your season, sized to your yard.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-300 md:text-4xl">78%</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-white">Increase in green-up</div>
          <div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-green-200/70">Turf treated with Genesis</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-300 md:text-4xl">9</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-white">Bundles, not one</div>
          <div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-green-200/70">3 turf zones × 3 lawn sizes</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-300 md:text-4xl">Zero</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-white">Synthetic chemicals</div>
          <div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-green-200/70">Safe for kids and pets</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-300 md:text-4xl">1×/mo</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-white">All you have to do</div>
          <div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-green-200/70">One product, one application</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PLAN -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-center font-heading text-3xl uppercase text-shopify-title md:text-4xl">
        Three steps to a better lawn.
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-xl text-center text-gray-600">
        The whole season, decided in one sitting.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-100 text-xl font-bold text-green-700"
          >
            1
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-1 text-lg font-bold text-shopify-title">
              <span class="text-[#44883E]">Answer</span> two questions.
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              Your turf zone and your lawn size. That is the whole quiz — no email, no waiting on a
              reply.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-100 text-xl font-bold text-green-700"
          >
            2
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-1 text-lg font-bold text-shopify-title">
              <span class="text-[#44883E]">Get</span> your bundle and your schedule.
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              We show the exact bundle plus the month-by-month plan for it. Add it to your cart in
              one click, or have the schedule emailed to you.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-100 text-xl font-bold text-green-700"
          >
            3
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-1 text-lg font-bold text-shopify-title">
              <span class="text-[#44883E]">Spray</span> once a month and let it work.
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              One product per month, the whole bottle, through a hose-end sprayer. About fifteen
              minutes a month for the entire season.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-center font-heading text-3xl uppercase text-shopify-title md:text-4xl">
        Questions we hear every week.
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-xl text-center text-gray-600">
        Straight answers before you spend a dollar.
      </p>
      <AccordionFaq items={faq} persona="lawn" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FINAL CTA -->
  <section class="bg-[#2C5234] py-16 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl uppercase md:text-4xl">Already have your bundle?</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-green-100">
        Dilution instructions and a month-by-month schedule for all nine bundles.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
        <a
          href="/lawn/instructions/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-white px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-[#2C5234] transition-colors hover:bg-green-50"
        >
          Bundle Instructions
        </a>
        <a
          href="/lawn/program/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border-2 border-white/30 px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:border-white/60 hover:bg-white/5"
        >
          The Full Program
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-green-200/80">
        Questions? Call <a href="tel:1-800-608-3755" class="font-semibold underline">800-608-3755</a
        > or email
        <a href="mailto:success@southlandorganics.com" class="font-semibold underline"
          >success@southlandorganics.com</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
